`POST https://graph.soundcloud.com/graphql?client_id={cid}` — two operations fire on a track page.

```graphql
query ResolvePermalink($input: ResolvePermalinkInput!) {
  resolvePermalink(input: $input) {
    __typename
    ... on TrackShare { trackUrn access }
    ... on Track { share { __typename trackUrn access } }
  }
}
```
```json
{ "input": { "permalink": "tien-pham-418156952/she-neva-know-lofi-ver" } }
```

```graphql
query TrackBuyModule($allTracksInput: AllTracksInput!) {
  allTracks(allTracksInput: $allTracksInput) {
    urn
    buyModule { item { __typename title linkTitle link } }
  }
}
```
```json
{ "allTracksInput": { "trackKeys": [ { "urn": "soundcloud:tracks:1068221248", "secretToken": null } ] } }
```

GraphQL is not used for the track itself — only for share access and the buy-link module.
